!iflang [english]

!begin_node Cookie, VFIX

(!B)(!nolink [VDI])-Fix(!b)

Patch to remove the handle problem described in (!I)ST-Magazin(!i) 1/90 in 
the VDI of TOS 1.0, TOS 1.02, TOS 1.04, TOS 1.06, TOS 1.62, TOS 2.05,
TOS 2.06, TOS 2.07, TOS 3.00 and the ST Book ROM.

Modifies the TRAP #2 vector.

!end_node

!else

!begin_node Cookie, VFIX

(!B)(!nolink [VDI])-Fix(!b)

Beseitigt das in (!I)ST-Magazin(!i) 1/90 beschriebene Handle-Problem im
(!nolink [VDI]) von (!nolink [TOS]) 1.0, (!nolink [TOS]) 1.02, (!nolink [TOS])
1.04, (!nolink [TOS]) 1.06, (!nolink [TOS]) 1.62, (!nolink [TOS]) 2.05,
(!nolink [TOS]) 2.06, (!nolink [TOS]) 2.07, (!nolink [TOS]) 3.00 und dem
ST-Book-ROM

Ver„ndert TRAP #2-Vektor.

!end_node

